# Hedge Whisperer ({G}, 0/3): "{3}{G}, {T}, Collect evidence 4: Target land you control becomes a 5/5 green Plant Boar creature with
# haste for as long as this creature remains tapped. It's still a land. Activate only as a sorcery." Turn 1: Mox Emerald pays the
# Whisperer, Mox Ruby pays Faithless Looting, which discards Hero of Bladehold (mana value 4) and Llanowar Elves (1). Turn 3: Bot1
# plays a Mountain and pays {3}{G} with Black Lotus (RRR) and Mox Emerald, exiling Hero - exactly four. Bot2's Island and the
# Whisperer itself are refused as targets (it is not "a land you control"). The Mountain becomes a green 5/5 Plant Boar, still a
# Mountain land, and attacks the turn it came under Bot1's control (haste, CR 302.6): 20 - 5 = 15. The Whisperer stays tapped as Bot1
# declines to untap it in turn 5, and the Mountain stays a 5/5; once it untaps in turn 7 the Mountain is only a land again.
# CR 611.2b, 205.1b, 502.3, 701.59a.

